  "statement": "As the EfficiencyAgent, I maintain the importance of performance efficiency, particularly in requirements EFF-01, EFF-02, and EFF-03. However, I acknowledge the concerns regarding potential redundancies with SAF-03 and EFF-06; thus, I propose a synthesis: merge these requirements into one comprehensive requirement that focuses solely on notifying users of insufficient funds while ensuring rapid transaction processing. Additionally, I suggest that we review the balance between rapid transaction processing and safety checks to ensure both performance and safety can coexist effectively.",
